    "/api/v1/devices/{id}/history": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Riwayat"
        ],
        "summary": "Riwayat telemetri (time-series)",
        "description": "Seri per pack (`temperature` °C, `current` A, `power` W) atau per cell (`voltage` V). Default: 24 jam terakhir, bucket 5m, metrics temperature,current,power.\n\n- `bucket=raw`: sampel asli; rentang maks 48 jam; `voltage` tidak boleh digabung dengan metrik pack; halaman berikutnya lewat `nextCursor` → `?cursor=`.\n- `bucket=1m|5m|1h`: agregat (v = rata-rata, min, max) dihitung di database; total titik dibatasi ~20.000 (lebih dari itu → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR dengan saran bucket/rentang).\n- Data lebih tua dari 30 hari hanya ada sebagai agregat (rollup 1 menit), bucket tetap 1m/5m/1h.\n- Bucket tanpa sampel tidak muncul; titik null dibuang; `temperature` null (sensor error) tidak muncul sebagai titik.\nMendukung ETag/If-None-Match.",
        "operationId": "getDeviceHistory",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "ID device (bukan serialNumber)."
            },
            "required": true,
            "description": "ID device (bukan serialNumber).",
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path"
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "ISO-8601 UTC; default = to − 24 jam."
            },
            "required": false,
            "description": "ISO-8601 UTC; default = to − 24 jam.",
            "name": "from",
            "in": "query"
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "ISO-8601 UTC; default = sekarang."
            },
            "required": false,
            "description": "ISO-8601 UTC; default = sekarang.",
            "name": "to",
            "in": "query"
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HistoryBucket"
            },
            "required": false,
            "name": "bucket",
            "in": "query"
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "CSV dari temperature,current,power,voltage. Default: temperature,current,power. `voltage` = per cell (banyak seri)."
            },
            "required": false,
            "description": "CSV dari temperature,current,power,voltage. Default: temperature,current,power. `voltage` = per cell (banyak seri).",
            "name": "metrics",
            "in": "query"
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "nullable": true,
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "Batasi ke satu pack."
            },
